## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Quest Log
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.5.0
## Notes: The campaign ledger — one double-wide window over the whole quest log: every quest listed down the left under its zone, searchable and sortable and filterable, with the full briefing on the right — objectives with their progress, the description, every reward with its tooltip — and Track, Share, Announce and Abandon on the same screen. Under the list, two clocks: the daily reset, and the weekly reset that pays arena points and clears raid lockouts. It replaces the stock quest log rather than sitting beside it. With Questie installed, a Zones tab turns it into a completionist's guide: pick a zone, or let it follow you, and see every quest it holds for this character — done, open, locked and why, missed and why — with a completion bar, the chains in order, and what to do next. The world map gets the same zone in a drawer down its right edge, with pins on the quest givers Questie does not draw. Waypoints, and a nearest-first route through every open quest in a zone, go to the Commander Orders arrow.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Scroll_11
